{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18f79ca3712d8bf4a9956f59ad76b270db7c54da465cfae2269a149715af80fe", "ja": "（可憐と次のライブの打ち合わせをするはずが、\n渋滞で遅刻してしまった……可憐、待ってるよな）", "zh": "（本来要和可怜商量下一场演出的事，却因为堵车迟到了……可怜还在等我吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5d809aaa6e825ad66af13c2b2d845eb399d0e60869226b96404c44c6d4f0c29d", "ja": "可憐、遅くなってごめん！\n……あれ？　衣装……？", "zh": "可怜，抱歉我迟到了！\n……咦？这是演出服……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "6230d65dde0d007dc75ce155b58a93b410a7baff9a67c97a2892ec946de1443a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お、お疲れさまです……\nは、はい。遅れるって、連絡をもらったので……", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛、辛苦了……\n是、是的。因为收到了您说会迟到的联系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "ac23d05504af2538e8a42d49a09795eb8f3248c2c9bc0803d83babf6c7b0c621", "ja": "先に、衣装の試着をしていました……。\nあ、あの、ダメでしたか……？", "zh": "我先试穿了一下演出服……  \n那、那个，不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a212c6aedaad5476c025f312846959b214a94155ab973b3e539a32caedc7d4ef", "ja": "いや、全然ダメじゃないよ。ありがとう！\n新しい衣装、よく似合ってるな。", "zh": "不，完全没问题。谢谢你！\n这套新服装很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "debddd586458d3e8c315f407ab8212784af3195b43016ccdff6460e6882cdfb5", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。こんなにも\n素敵な衣装をもらえて、ほ、本当にうれしいです……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……。能得到这么漂亮的服装，我、我真的非常开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "7071808d77d4b8eb35781042f46f8302d9a976c33e433582c62db416b895b4d3", "ja": "それで……あの、{$P$}さんに、\nお願いがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "所以……那个，我有件事想拜托{$P$}先生……可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "95531c8346a8347ad31bf946c329bab8ca88ef8387c938642dcff87467ac967e", "ja": "こ、この衣装を着て……劇場の周りを、\n散歩してきたら……だ、ダメですか……？", "zh": "这、这套服装……穿着它去剧场周围散散步……不、不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2944352c88b571d9fe101f8748b6c5a7fc17cd254dc6eb4fd9c87efcf8ceb946", "ja": "え、散歩って……衣装で？", "zh": "诶，散步是指……穿着演出服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c76e1b7558f07169277a16aed3052439de94fac02cf39f4275caae185fe2ad4", "ja": "は、はい……。こ、この衣装で、\n野外ライブをすると聞いたので……。", "zh": "是、是的……我听说要穿着这套服装举办户外演唱会……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "8395e2df593d5fb81d392d66a2c148d45f47f431e51403dd927778fbeb9f00bf", "ja": "そ、外に出て……感覚や、匂いを……\n知っておきたいなって、思ったんです……。", "zh": "我、我想先到外面去……感受一下那里的感觉、气味……所以才这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2cd9e5231e4dce5bf9b958b4d145cc693192df3b6481ea1c1048dce2cfffd1de", "ja": "なるほど。可憐なりに、\nライブの準備を考えたって事か……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，你按照可怜自己的方式，考虑了演出的准备工作啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f861f9cf14de7bea19f37061dcc0e5e60da74af0cf99bab5b8671d64e2933e3f", "ja": "けど、さすがにその衣装で歩くのはな……。\n劇場周辺とはいえ、かなり目立つと思うし。", "zh": "不过，穿着那身服装走在外面，果然还是有点……  \n虽说是在剧场附近，但我觉得还是会相当引人注目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "a820c9e1817f329f9bdaf2f48a9c7a94a91d365008823d063860ff757cc8e2df", "ja": "あ……そ、そう、ですよね……あうう……。\n私って、いつもこうだなぁ……。", "zh": "啊……是、是啊……呜呜……。\n我总是这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ee6fb971b93742ecec576ef528948641a5376cea316445a2c7f67fec14023298", "ja": "いや、前向きなのはいいことだと思うよ。\n散歩は無理だけど、その調子でイメトレしてくれ！", "zh": "不，我觉得积极是件好事哦。\n虽然去散步行不通，但就照这个劲头进行意象训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "d737f06e1a661a3fa150c9357f389df4f783c680d40422e28e6bb03f11b75752", "ja": "イメトレ……。\nそ、そうですよね……がんばります……！", "zh": "想象训练……。\n是、是啊……我会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "f4f6e2ed9c5bdba028a12a687d4c76159564f044ddc628510e8bb49bcc49cab2", "ja": "あれ……？　くんくん、くんくん……。\nなんだか、土と、草木の匂いがします……。", "zh": "咦……？闻闻，嗅嗅……\n总觉得，有一股泥土和草木的气味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "87c156615e8907dd7ee8d797bdb4a6a5e632156cc5f3ca31a08fefeb981631e0", "ja": "この匂い……\nもしかして、{$P$}さんから……？", "zh": "这个气味……\n难道是从{$P$}先生传来的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ad0562b36694570ca14d7f4bbd98568cfb581c203f9f5d1321138b1236307620", "ja": "あ、そうかもな？　さっき、\n野外ステージの視察に行ってきたところだから……。", "zh": "啊，可能是吧？我刚才才去视察了露天舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "93470cc8b70776346007ea89edf356c9296ff0fcefd4a053f4b96aa2a01e5e47", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですね……\nそれで、渋滞に……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n所以，是堵车了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "cbe920fe403cfacd3d76e56c3a745500e2c336933db13001061008cc68280592", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……。\nちょっとだけ、隣にいても、いいですか……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……  \n我可以稍微在您身边待一会儿吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "796aa963d35c86461d63d0afc1a68eb7456f2ca7c67ded663fc97dd2d366bc74", "ja": "こ、この匂いの、そばにいれば、私……\n外にいる気分に……なれそうな気がして……。", "zh": "只、只要待在这个气味旁边，我……好像就能有种身处外面的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0174_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f0885b0e515c52fd77d0b78f55271637d605985e62684ba8b7d60ad43d1a54dc", "ja": "（その後しばらく、可憐は俺の後をついてきていた……\n無事、イメトレができたみたいで良かったな！）", "zh": "（之后有一阵子，可怜一直跟在我身后……看来她顺利完成了想象练习，太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
